-- F7 CLINIC STOREYS (prompts/DXF2BIM_FOUNDATION_LANE.md, 2026-10-22): the Viewer loads the WHOLE buildings/Clinic.db (no _meta/_geo split on OCI), which carries NO spatial_structure,
-- so the 2D wand (viewer/wing_2d.js, offered when IfcBuildingStorey rows > 2) and every declared-storey rule saw none. This block = every IfcBuilding + IfcBuildingStorey the 5 Clinic IFCs declare
-- (Clinic_{Architectural,Electrical,HVAC,Plumbing,Structural}_IFC2x3.ifc): GlobalId, Name, Elevation x the file's own IfcSIUnit LENGTHUNIT (METRE: ARC/ELEC/STR, MILLI: HVAC/PLB), parent = IfcRelAggregates.
-- Written by scripts/gen_storey_patch.js (no hand edits). Idempotent: deletes only its own GUIDs, never the Room walker's RM_/STC_ rows. Witness: scripts/probe_storey_patch_deploy.js (W-CLINIC-STOREYS).
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS spatial_structure (guid TEXT, type TEXT, name TEXT, parent_guid TEXT, object_type TEXT, predefined_type TEXT, center_x REAL, center_y REAL, center_z REAL, size_x REAL, size_y REAL, size_z REAL, elevation REAL);
